@startuml dataflow_micro_content_pipeline
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam SequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #555555
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #999999

title Luồng dữ liệu: Micro-Content Generation Pipeline\n(Indexed Chunks -> Lesson Cards Draft)

actor "Giảng viên" as GV
participant "Next.js UI\n(web-bff)" as Web
participant "core-api" as Core
queue "Redis\nBullMQ + Pub/Sub" as Redis
participant "enrichment-worker" as Enrich
database "PostgreSQL\nchunks + LO + cards" as PG
database "Neo4j\nKnowledge Graph" as Neo4j
database "Qdrant\nlearning_chunks" as Qdrant
participant "LLM API\nGemini/Provider Adapter" as LLM

== 0. Tiền điều kiện ==
note over PG, Qdrant
  Document/Video pipeline đã kết thúc ở INDEXED.
  Chunks hoặc transcript segments đã search được trong Qdrant.
end note

== 1. Yêu cầu sinh lesson cards ==
GV -> Web : Generate Micro-Content\n(course/chapter/section)
Web -> Core : POST /content-generations\n{type="card", scope}
Core -> PG : INSERT outbox_events\nContentGenerationRequested
Core -> Redis : enqueue ContentGenerationRequested\n{type=card, scope}
Core --> Web : {request_id, status=QUEUED}

== 2. Gom nhóm ngữ cảnh ==
Enrich -> Redis : consume ContentGenerationRequested
Enrich -> PG : SELECT chunks\nby heading_path cấp 2
Enrich -> Neo4j : SELECT related LO / Chapter\nfor scope
Neo4j --> Enrich : LO statements\n+ prerequisite concepts
Enrich -> Qdrant : retrieve supporting chunks\nfilter={course_id, lo_ids}
Qdrant --> Enrich : grounding_chunks[]
Enrich -> Enrich : aggregate context\nlimit <= 4000 tokens

== 3. Sinh card theo JSON schema ==
loop mỗi lesson unit
    Enrich -> LLM : generate_lesson_card\n(context, LO, strict JSON schema)
    LLM --> Enrich : {title, key_insights[], bullets[]}
    Enrich -> Enrich : validate schema\nsanitize markdown
end

== 4. Lưu bản nháp ==
Enrich -> PG : INSERT lesson_cards\nstatus=GENERATED_DRAFT\nsource_chunk_ids, lo_ids
Enrich -> Redis : publish ContentDraftGenerated\n{type=card}

== 5. Cập nhật giao diện ==
Redis --> Web : progress + draft ready
Web --> GV : Hiển thị card trong\nReview Inbox

@enduml
